":"0052cc"},"performed_via_github_app":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/899429152","html_url":"https://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9002#issuecomment-899429152","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/9002","id":899429152,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAT2ozs41nDMg","user":{"login":"pavelperc","id":31820550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODIwNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31820550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc","html_url":"https://github.com/pavelperc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-08-16T11:15:41Z","updated_at":"2021-08-24T12:14:32Z","body":"We also got this crash. It is an android 11 bug, look here: https://stackoverflow.com/questions/66652819/getting-security-exception-while-trying-to-fetch-networkcapabilities-on-android\r\n\r\nHere is stack trace:\r\n```\r\nCaused by java.lang.SecurityException: Package android does not belong to 10186\r\n       at android.os.Parcel.createExceptionOrNull(Parcel.java:2373)\r\n       at android.os.Parcel.createException(Parcel.java:2357)\r\n       at android.os.Parcel.readException(Parcel.java:2340)\r\n       at android.os.Parcel.readException(Parcel.java:2282)\r\n       at android.net.IConnectivityManager$Stub$Proxy.getNetworkCapabilities(IConnectivityManager.java:2456)\r\n       at android.net.ConnectivityManager.getNetworkCapabilities(ConnectivityManager.java:1385)\r\n       at com.google.android.exoplayer2.scheduler.Requirements.isInternetConnectivityValidated(Requirements.java:215)\r\n       at com.google.android.exoplayer2.scheduler.Requirements.getNotMetNetworkRequirements(Requirements.java:162)\r\n       at com.google.android.exoplayer2.scheduler.Requirements.getNotMetRequirements(Requirements.java:137)\r\n       at com.google.android.exoplayer2.scheduler.RequirementsWatcher.start(RequirementsWatcher.java:86)\r\n       at com.google.android.exoplayer2.offline.DownloadManager.<init>(DownloadManager.java:278)\r\n       at com.google.android.exoplayer2.offline.DownloadManager.<init>(DownloadManager.java:230)\r\n```\r\nExoPlayer version: 2.12.2\r\n\r\nSeems like you need to wrap this line into try catch:\r\nhttps://github.com/google/ExoPlayer/blob/r2.15.0/library/core/src/main/java/com/google/android/exoplayer2/scheduler/Requirements.java#L215","author_association":"NONE","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/google/ExoPlayer/issues/comments/899429152/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"pavelperc","id":31820550,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjMxODIwNTUw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/31820550?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc","html_url":"https://github.com/pavelperc","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pavelperc/orgs","